            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "UpbeatSoy2569"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Awesome doggo cakes! Today is my boys first birthday, so I made him some birthday cakes. I omitted the carrots, and made a frosting out of peanut butter and mashed banana. Added a couple of blueberries on top. He absolutely loves it! Used my mini dash pie maker. Perfect ❤️",
            "datePublished": "2023-09-22T16:41:34.398Z"
          },
          {
