            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Terri Marie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this today for our Noah's 4th birthday. I substituted the peanut butter with a banana and made cup cakes rather than a whole cake. I cooked them for 18 minutes at 160 Celsius in a fan oven. Absolutely perfect and he loved them! I had a taste myself - they were lovely and moist 🙂",
            "datePublished": "2026-08-08T12:57:44.818Z"
